                <mxCell id="bwLegend" value="Every arrow is a real constructor / @Autowired dependency, read off the source.&amp;#10;  green   controller -&amp;gt; flow or service        blue  flow -&amp;gt; service&amp;#10;  orange  service -&amp;gt; repo                      red dashed  same-package call&amp;#10;  grey dashed boxes  exist but nothing wires them yet (NotificationRepo, AuditLogRepo)&amp;#10;  dashed boxes in workflow/  stateless mappers, called statically, not injected&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Shortcuts worth knowing:&amp;#10;  DirectoryFlow and EmployeeImportFlow both delegate writes to HrEmployeeFlow -&amp;#10;  one place creates a user+employee pair, so the rules cannot drift.&amp;#10;  LeaveApprovalService is the whole approve/reject state machine; it moves the&amp;#10;  request AND writes the ledger entry, so balances stay derived, never stored.&amp;#10;  JwtService depends on UserService to check sessions_revoked_at on every request.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Click any box to open the file." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#999999;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=4;fontSize=10;fontColor=#333333;" parent="1" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="40" y="610" width="880" height="190" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
            </root>
